@NODE iNTRODUCTiON "iNTRODUCTiON OF MiNi-MESSAGE VERSiON 1.0"

MiNi-MESSAGE iS A SMALL TOOL WHO iNFORMS THE USERS ABOUT THAT THE
SYSOP HAS DECiDED TO CHANGE THE SYSTEM-PASSWORD OF HiS BBS.
iT HAS @{"FEATURES" LiNK FEATURES} THAT OTHER TOOLS DOESN'T HAVE.

@ENDNODE

@NODE FEATURES "FEATURES OF MiNi-MESSAGE VERSiON 1.0"

THiS TOOL iNFORMS THE USER WiTH A SMALL VERY NiCE ANiMATiON THAT
THE SYSTEM-PASSWORD WiLL CHANGE SOMEDAY. i DECiDED TO MAKE THiS
TOOL, BECAUSE ON MY OPiNiON iT iS NOT THE BEST SOLUTiON TO WRiTE
A MESSAGE TO iNFORM THE USER ABOUT THE CHANGES, BECAUSE MOST USERS
ARE OFTEN iN A HURRY OR NOT iNTERESTED iN READiNG MESSAGES FROM THE
SYSOP. WiTH THiS TOOL PLACED SOMEWHERE iN THE LOGON-SCREEN EVERY USER
iS FORCED TO SEE THE NEWS. SO NOBODY WON'T FORGET THE iMPORTANT MESSAGE.

iT HAS NO CONFiG-FiLES AND WORKS FULLY WiTH TOOL-TYPES iN THE iCON.

AND NOW i THiNK i GAVE YOU ENOUGH REASONS TO iNSTALL MiNi-MESSAGE V1.0 :)

@ENDNODE

@NODE iNSTALLATiON "iNSTALLATiON OF MiNi-MESSAGE VERSiON 1.0"

iNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V2.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV2.xx}.

iNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V3.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV3.xx}.

@ENDNODE

@NODE AMiEXPRESSV2.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V2.xx"

TO iNSTALL THE DOOR LOAD UP THE CUSTOMCOMMANDS (/X V2.2x OR BELOW) OR
SYS.CMD (/X V2.3x) AND ADD THE FOLLOWiNG LiNE TO THE LiST.


          11 SPACES iN         
          |
--------------------------------------------------------          
*MiNi     RM010MODULES:MM_TOOLS/MiNiMESSAGE/MiNi_MESSAGE
--------------------------------------------------------
||        |||  |           
||        |||  ` 'MODULES:MM_TOOLS/MiNiMESSAGE/MiNi_MESSAGE' iS
||        |||     THE LOCATiON OF THE FiLE.
||        |||
||        ||` 010 THE MiNiMUM ACCESS TO USE THiS DOOR. CHANGE iT TO WHAT
||        ||      YOU LiKE.
||        ||
||        |` 'M' FOR A MULTiNODE BBS ('S' FOR A SiNGLE NODE BBS).
||        |
||        ` 'R' FOR A REXX DOOR WHiCH WiLL USE THE 'REXXDOOR'-UTiL.
||
|`COMMAND TO START THE DOOR.
|
`-RETARD OPTiON. TO MAKE SURE THEY ONLY USE 'MiNi' & ONLY  'MiNi'
  TO GET THE DOOR TO COME UP. iF NOT USED, THiNGS SUCH AS 'MiNiMAX'
  AND 'MiNiMUFFTi' WOULD STiLL BRiNG UP THE DOOR.


  USE THE LiNE BETWEEN THE LiNES ONLY. THE OTHER PARTS ARE JUST AN
  EXPLANATiON TO MAKE SURE YOU KNOW WHAT EACH PART iS DOiNG (SiNCE
  NOONE WOULD TELL ME BACK iN THE DAYS WHERE i DiDN'T KNOW WHAT WAS
  GOiNG ON!)  

  NOW COPY THE DiRECTORY 'MODULES' FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS.

  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"TOOLTYPES" LiNK TOOLTYPES} OF 'MiNi_MESSAGE.iNFO'.
  YOU WiLL FiND iT iN 'BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/MiNiMESSAGE/'.


  NOW ADD THE FOLLOWiNG TO YOUR LOGON.TXT AND LOGON.TXT.GR

  --------------CUT HERE----------------
  ~CC_MiNi
  --------------CUT HERE----------------

 
  THAT'S ALL...

@ENDNODE

@NODE AMiEXPRESSV3.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V3.xx"

  COPY ALL THE FiLES FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS AND

  ADD THE FOLLOWiNG TO YOUR LOGON.TXT AND LOGON.TXT.GR


  --------------CUT HERE----------------
  ~CC_MiNi
  --------------CUT HERE----------------



  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"TOOLTYPES" LiNK TOOLTYPES} OF 'MiNi_MESSAGE.iNFO'.
  YOU WiLL FiND iT iN 'BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/MiNiMESSAGE/'.

@ENDNODE

@NODE TOOLTYPES "HOW TO EDiT THE TOOLTYPES?"

  OLDSYSPW=<word>                        THE <word> DEFiNES YOUR ACTUAL
                                         SYSTEM-PASSWORD.

                                         !!! ATTENTiON !!!
                                       
                                         DUE TO THE ANiMATiON YOU ARE
                                         ALLOWED TO USE WORD WiTH ONLY
                                         4 (FOUR) CHARACTERS LiKE
                                         'WASA', 'GURU', 'HANS' etc.

                                         E.G.: OLDSYSPW=HUGO


  OLDSYSPW=<word>                        THE <word> DEFiNES YOUR ACTUAL
                                         SYSTEM-PASSWORD.

                                         !!! ATTENTiON !!!
                                       
                                         DUE TO THE ANiMATiON YOU ARE
                                         ALLOWED TO USE WORD WiTH ONLY
                                         4 (FOUR) CHARACTERS LiKE
                                         'WASA', 'GURU', 'HANS' etc.

                                         E.G.: NEWSYSPW=JOGO


  NEWDATE=<date>                         THE <date> DEFiNES THE DATE
                                         WHEN THE SYSTEM-PASSWORD WiLL
                                         CHANGE.

                                         !!! ATTENTiON !!!

                                         DUE TO THE ANiMATiON YOU ARE
                                         ALLOWED TO USE WORD WiTH ONLY
                                         8 (EiGHT) CHARACTERS LiKE
                                         '21.03.94' ,'21th May'

                                         E.G.: NEWDATE=01.08.94


  THAT SHOULD BE ALL FOR NOW...


@ENDNODE       

